---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Last updated: June 2026. How we protect your data."
>
  <div class="space-y-6 text-stone-600 font-normal leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
    <p>
      At Premier Properties, accessible from properties.example.com, one of our main priorities is the privacy of our visitors. This Privacy Policy document contains types of information that is collected and recorded by Premier Properties and how we use it.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-display text-stone-900 pt-4 border-t border-stone-100">Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
      If you contact us directly through our inquiry forms, we may receive additional information about you such as your name, email address, phone number, the contents of the message and/or attachments you may send us, and any other information you may choose to provide.
    </p>
    <p>
      We use this information solely to process your property inquiries, contact you back, coordinate site visits, and prepare legal documentation if you decide to buy, sell, or rent a property with us.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-display text-stone-900 pt-4 border-t border-stone-100">How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
      <li>Provide, operate, and maintain our website and listings.</li>
      <li>Improve, personalize, and expand our website user experience.</li>
      <li>Understand and analyze how you use our website.</li>
      <li>Respond directly to your comments, questions, and form submissions.</li>
      <li>Prevent fraud and ensure legal validity of transactions.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-display text-stone-900 pt-4 border-t border-stone-100">Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>
      We use Netlify to host our website, which collects standard server access logs. Netlify Forms are used to process submission queries. Decap CMS is used for content management. These services process your data in accordance with their respective security certifications and privacy frameworks. We do not sell or lease your contact information to third-party marketing companies.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-display text-stone-900 pt-4 border-t border-stone-100">Consent</h2>
    <p>
      By using our website, you hereby consent to our Privacy Policy and agree to its terms.
    </p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
